commit 620b91b5a0763917bdc8442d0981e42696c31545
Author:     Erik Sjölund <erik.sjolund@gmail.com>
AuthorDate: Mon Feb 10 19:34:15 2025 +0100
Commit:     Erik Sjölund <erik.sjolund@gmail.com>
CommitDate: Mon Feb 10 19:34:15 2025 +0100

    utils: fix PATH lookup
    
    Support filenames starting with a dot when
    doing PATH lookup.
    
    Fixes: https://github.com/containers/crun/issues/1664
    
    Signed-off-by: Erik Sjölund <erik.sjolund@gmail.com>

